{"title":"Find The K Th Lucky Number","difficulty":"Medium","statement":"We know that 4 and 7 are lucky digits. Also, a number is called lucky if it contains only lucky digits.\nYou are given an integer k, return the kth lucky number represented as a string.\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1\n\n```text\nInput: k = 4\nOutput: \"47\"\n```\nExplanation: The first lucky number is 4, the second one is 7, the third one is 44 and the fourth one is 47.\n\n### Example 2\n\n```text\nInput: k = 10\nOutput: \"477\"\n```\nExplanation: Here are lucky numbers sorted in increasing order:\n4, 7, 44, 47, 74, 77, 444, 447, 474, 477. So the 10th lucky number is 477.\n### Example 3\n\n```text\nInput: k = 1000\nOutput: \"777747447\"\n```\nExplanation: It can be shown that the 1000th lucky number is 777747447.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- 1 <= k <= 10^9\n","starterCode":"class Solution:\n    def kthLuckyNumber(self, k: int) -> str:\n        pass\n","entryPoint":"Solution().kthLuckyNumber","parameters":[{"name":"k","type":"int"}],"returnType":"str","tests":[{"input":[1],"expected":"4"},{"input":[10],"expected":"477"},{"input":[1000],"expected":"777747447"},{"input":[1000000000],"expected":"77477744774747744747444444447"},{"input":[100149904],"expected":"47777774444474747474474447"},{"input":[100617678],"expected":"47777777774744774777447777"},{"input":[101823754],"expected":"74444744477477474744447477"},{"input":[104995142],"expected":"74474444744447744747444777"},{"input":[105308856],"expected":"74474447747774447474777447"},{"input":[106046332],"expected":"74474744744474447747777747"},{"input":[106730297],"expected":"74474777447447447744777474"},{"input":[107568199],"expected":"74477474474747774447447444"},{"input":[108026500],"expected":"74477744444747747474444747"},{"input":[108127102],"expected":"74477744477774447747777777"},{"input":[108363357],"expected":"74477747474777777447477774"},{"input":[108985032],"expected":"74477777747777747477447447"},{"input":[116663571],"expected":"74777747444474